to laboratory and pilot scale based on matched k(L)a</article-title><source>Biotechnol Bioeng</source><year>2008</year><volume>99</volume><fpage>1128</fpage><lpage>1139</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17969169</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B13"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Chen</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Chitta</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Chang</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Amanullah</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Twenty-four well plate miniature bioreactor system as a scale-down model for cell culture process development</article-title><source>Biotechnol Bioeng</source><year>2009</year><volume>102</volume><fpage>148</fpage><lpage>160</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18683260</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B14"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Isett</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>George</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Herber</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name><name><surname>Amanullah</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Twenty-four-well plate miniature bioreactor high-throughput system: assessment for microbial cultivations</article-title><source>Biotechnol Bioeng</source><year>2007</year><volume>98</volume><fpage>1017</fpage><lpage>1028</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17486656</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B15"><citation citation-type="other"><article-title>EasySelect Pichia Expression Kit</article-title><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://tools.invitrogen.com/content/sfs/manuals/easyselect_man.pdf"/></citation></ref><ref id="B16"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Montgomery</surname><given-names>DC</given-names></name></person-group><so