></name><name><surname>Donner</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Carrondo</surname><given-names>MJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Methanol induction optimization for scFv antibody fragment production in Pichia pastoris</article-title><source>Biotechnol Bioeng</source><year>2004</year><volume>86</volume><fpage>458</fpage><lpage>467</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15112298</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B20"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Woo</surname><given-names>JH</given-names></name><name><surname>Liu</surname><given-names>YY</given-names></name><name><surname>Stavrou</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Neville</surname><given-names>DM</given-names><suffix>Jr</suffix></name></person-group><article-title>Increasing secretion of a bivalent anti-T-cell immunotoxin by Pichia pastoris</article-title><source>Appl Environ Microbiol</source><year>2004</year><volume>70</volume><fpage>3370</fpage><lpage>3376</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15184133</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B21"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Breyfogle</surname><given-names>FW</given-names></name></person-group><source>Implementing Six Sigma: smarter solutions using statistical methods</source><year>2003</year><publisher-name>New York: John Wiley and Sons, Inc</publisher-name><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16220958</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B22"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Cos</surname><given-names>O</given-names></name><name><surname>Ramon</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Montesinos</surname><given-names>JL</given-names></name><name><surname>Valero</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Operational strategies, monitoring and control of heterologous protein production in the methylotrophic 